              "value": "(aura, olfactory)\n\n10 feet. A creature entering the aura or starting its turn in the aura must succeed at a 14 Fortitude save or become flat-footed for 1 round (and slowed 1 for 1 round on a critical failure). A creature that succeeds at its save is temporarily immune for 1 minute."
